WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:02.940
It's the most wonderful time of the year!

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:06.720
The 12,020 human space era calendar has arrived.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.160
You can order it now until we sell out,
and then never again.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.660
In the last few years, we've
looked back at the achievements of our

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:16.660
ancestors that paved the way for our
modern world more than

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.020
ten thousand years ago.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.360
This year, we'll turn our gaze to the future of humanity

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:25.160
and how we will explore space
in the next ten thousand years.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.160
Twelve illustrations will take you
to the liquid-gas oceans on Titan,

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.420
colonies on Mars,

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.320
the storm clouds on Uranus,

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:35.720
and many more stops
on humanity's biggest journey yet.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.680
Enjoy solar system-wide delivery, shipping from the US and finally, also from Europe.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.720
Order now to get our limited-edition
calendar in time for the holidays to

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:48.340
make your kids, family, and friends happy

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:51.820
or to distract yourself from the looming void within.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.700
You know, whatever works for you.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:58.080
You can get the calendar together with a duck plushie, a hoodie, or a poster, if you want;

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.780
we've put together a few deals.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:03.720
Thank you so much to the thousands
of people who got the calendar last year.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:08.840
Because of you, we can keep this channel
free for everyone and make even more beautiful things.

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:11.980
A happy interstellar year, 12,020!

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:18.840
*Quieter Kurzgesagt jingle*

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:22.740
*howls*

